    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Incipient superconductivity and tunable Chern insulators in twisted Bernal bilayer-trilayer graphene
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Waleffe%2C+D">Derek Waleffe</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bhattacharyya%2C+A">Aryana Bhattacharyya</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kumar%2C+M">Manish Kumar</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Maginnis%2C+E">Eric Maginnis</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Okounkova%2C+A">Anna Okounkova</a>, 
      
